			"notes": "# I Am Zombie? 1.1.3\n\nVersion 1.1.3 adds separately packaged NeoForge builds for Minecraft 1.21.8,\n1.21.10, 1.21.11, 26.1, and 26.2. Install only the JAR whose `+mc...` suffix\nmatches your Minecraft version.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- Fixed a client crash during the configuration stage on older supported Minecraft versions.\n- Restored Herobrine right-click interactions on pre-26.2 NeoForge without duplicate handling.\n- Retained the Windows NTFS configuration-migration fix and its fail-closed identity checks.\n\n## Java requirements\n\n| Minecraft | Java |\n|---|---|\n| 1.21.8 | Java 22 or 25 |\n| 1.21.10 | Java 22 or 25 |\n| 1.21.11 | Java 25 |\n| 26.1 | Java 25 |\n| 26.2 | Java 25 |\n\n## SHA-256\n\n| File | SHA-256 |\n|---|---|\n| `iamzombieq-1.1.3+mc1.21.8.jar` | `9ef3d36521d95b239ffdcde6f07caefefd7b2d93a6211860918ea6ba3fc2a1d0` |\n| `iamzombieq-1.1.3+mc1.21.10.jar` | `9251d6144c41482594d71a92a9d65d2b0788bbbbc5aaea6f58fa239e0cc77bb5` |\n| `iamzombieq-1.1.3+mc1.21.11.jar` | `c2e921c6dce183f257babd93796455e84420098b3dcacc3fe4577c49fab1a6b5` |\n| `iamzombieq-1.1.3+mc26.1.jar` | `ad7f8a8abd0447c3e0ffdcf9aa35dea6df65d4a15aa6a4f53f24cd21c8483d08` |\n| `iamzombieq-1.1.3+mc26.2.jar` | `f720f53381cac2c4cf96af7e5e60cf07581b93ff01623c0cfd29068fba542c60` |\n\n---\n\n1.1.3 为 Minecraft 1.21.8、1.21.10、1.21.11、26.1 和 26.2 分别提供\nNeoForge 构建。请只安装文件名中 `+mc...` 后缀与你的 Minecraft 版本一致的 JAR。\n\n- 修复旧版 Minecraft 客户端在配置阶段的启动崩溃。\n- 恢复 NeoForge 26.2 之前版本的 Herobrine 右键交互，并避免重复处理。\n- 保留 Windows NTFS 配置迁移修复及其失败关闭身份检查。\n- 1.21.8、1.21.10 支持 Java 22 或 25；1.21.11、26.1、26.2 需要 Java 25。"
		}
